{"id":"wb-5-42","name":"临安城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"临安城","text":"临安城是南宋都城（1138年－1276年，共138年），位于今杭州市区的上城区和拱墅区辖区以内。南宋临安城遗址于2001年成为中国第五批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%B4%E5%AE%89%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":93757462,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93757462","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c6657a8e9dfa895bc93ca2d2.jpg","title":"20240109_Nan_Song_Deshou_Gong_Yizhi_Bowuguan_(112522).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240109_Nan_Song_Deshou_Gong_Yizhi_Bowuguan_(112522).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/99/20240109_Nan_Song_Deshou_Gong_Yizhi_Bowuguan_%28112522%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Deshou Palace Ruins Museum in Southern Song Dynasty","width":320,"height":240}}